course: dictionary
lesson: 548
title: Attempt: having a go
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Attempt is a word for trying. As a verb, «attempt» means to try to do something, especially something hard. «The climbers attempted the mountain in the snow.» They tried to climb it. The sentence does not say they reached the top, so an attempt can fail.
explain: As a noun, an attempt is one act of trying. «Mia made three attempts to jump the stream, and on the third she landed on the far bank.» Each try counts as one attempt, so three tries means three attempts.
explain: In sport, attempts are counted alongside successes: «Sam scored 6 goals in 10 attempts.» That means he tried to score ten times and got the ball in the net six times. The numbers and the word goals give you the clues.
fact: Attempt means to try, especially to try something difficult.
fact: As a noun, an attempt is one act of trying. "At the first attempt" means on the very first try.
fact: "Attempt to" and "in an attempt to" are often followed by a doing word, as in «in an attempt to win».
fact: «Kublai Khan's fleets twice tried to invade Japan, in 1274 and 1281, and both attempts failed, partly because of storms.» Here attempts means tries, and the storms help explain why they failed.
fact: In exams, «attempt all questions» means try every question, even if you are not sure of the answer.
exercise: The climbers decided to attempt the mountain in the snow. What does attempt mean here? | To ask a guide about it | To paint a picture of it | *To try to climb it | To buy a map of it
exercise: Sam scored 6 goals in 10 attempts. What is an attempt in this sentence? | *A try to score | A referee | A winning prize | A goal
exercise: «Attempt all questions» in an exam means what? | Skip the hard ones | Check your name only | *Try every question | Read the questions aloud
test: Mia tried again and again. In «at the first attempt she fell in», what does first attempt mean? | After the third try | When nobody is watching | At the end of the day | *On the very first try
test: In «The tiny robot made an attempt to climb the stairs», what does attempt mean? | *A try | A loud noise | A bright light | A set of stairs
exam: «Kublai Khan's fleets twice tried to invade Japan, and both attempts failed.» What does attempts mean here? | Sailors | Maps | *Tries | Storms
